[simonw]: I&#x27;m glad this article includes the only credible fix for the HTTP leak problems: CSP. A useful thing I learned recently is that, while CSP headers are usually set using HTTP headers, you can also reliably set them directly in HTML - for example for HTML generated directly on a page where HTTP headers don&#x27;t come into play:     &lt;iframe sandbox=&quot;allow-scripts&quot; srcdoc=&quot;
